{"version":3,"term":{"cols":104,"rows":17},"timestamp":1795744821,"command":"verify-then-connect --pace 0.45s","title":"ANS: verify, then connect","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.383, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1mANS · verify, then connect\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  Two agents over plain HTTPS. No mutual TLS. Each side proves itself with artifacts\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  from the transparency log; the other side checks them locally against one trusted key.\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  log key   kid=eceb0632\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  callee    ans://v1.0.0.payments.acme.example     leaf 0   ACTIVE\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "  caller    ans://v1.0.0.orders.acme.example       leaf 1   ACTIVE\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  revoked   ans://v1.0.0.ledger.acme.example       leaf 2   REVOKED\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  stale     ans://v1.0.0.billing.acme.example      leaf 3   status token expired 10 minutes ago\r\n"]
[2.704, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1m① Client side — connect and pray?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.454, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m TLS handshake with payments.acme.example: certificate CN=payments.acme.example, chain trusted\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[33m!\u001b[0m That is everything TLS tells you. Not whether this host is an ANS agent, whether\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "    this is the certificate the log vouches for, or whether the agent is still ACTIVE.\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m connect-and-pray would POST /v1/pay now, and hope.\r\n"]
[2.702, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1m② Client side — verify, then connect\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m GET https://payments.acme.example/healthz   (preflight — nothing sensitive sent)\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "    response carries X-SCITT-Receipt (255 B) and X-ANS-Status-Token (303 B)\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "      \u001b[2mverify  VerifyWithScitt: verifying receipt and status token\r\n              fqdn=payments.acme.example\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "      \u001b[2mverify  VerifyWithScitt: verification succeeded\r\n              fqdn=payments.acme.example tier=FullScitt tree_size=1 leaf_index=0 agent_status=ACTIVE\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m receipt: signed by the log key, leaf is in the tree (inclusion proof walked)\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m status token: signed by the log key, not expired, status ACTIVE\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m server certificate SHA256:8774ea9b… is in the token's valid_server_certs\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m VERIFIED (tier FullScitt). Now connect: POST /v1/pay\r\n"]
[2.701, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1m③ Client side — the agent has been revoked\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[2mThe receipt proves the agent was registered. The status token says whether it still is.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m GET https://ledger.acme.example/healthz   (preflight — nothing sensitive sent)\r\n"]
[0.453, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m TLS handshake: certificate CN=ledger.acme.example, chain trusted\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "    \u001b[31mconnect-and-pray is already paying a revoked agent.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "      \u001b[2mverify  VerifyWithScitt: verifying receipt and status token\r\n              fqdn=ledger.acme.example\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.228, "o", "      \u001b[2mverify  VerifyWithScitt: status token verification failed\r\n              fqdn=ledger.acme.example error=\"terminal status [REVOKED]: agent status is REVOKED\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m receipt: signed by the log key — the agent was registered (leaf 2)\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[0m status token: signed by the log key, and it says REVOKED\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m REFUSED before the first real request. Nothing was sent.\r\n"]
[2.703, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1m④ Client side — the status token has expired\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  \u001b[2mStatus tokens are short-lived. An agent the log has stopped vouching for can only\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "  \u001b[2mreplay its last good one, and that one runs out.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m GET https://billing.acme.example/healthz   (preflight — nothing sensitive sent)\r\n"]
[0.454, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m TLS handshake: certificate CN=billing.acme.example, chain trusted\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "      \u001b[2mverify  VerifyWithScitt: verifying receipt and status token\r\n              fqdn=billing.acme.example\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "      \u001b[2mverify  VerifyWithScitt: status token verification failed\r\n              fqdn=billing.acme.example error=\"token expired (exp=1795744222, now=1795744849): token\r\n              expired at 1795744222, now 1795744849 (skew 120s)\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m receipt: signed by the log key — the agent was registered (leaf 3)\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[0m status token: signed by the log key, but it expired 10 minutes ago\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m REFUSED before the first real request. Nothing was sent.\r\n"]
[2.702, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1m⑤ Server side — the callee verifies the caller (no client certificate)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m POST https://payments.acme.example/v1/pay\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "    with DPoP proof + X-SCITT-Receipt + X-ANS-Status-Token\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[2mthe proof signs method, URL, body digest, a fresh jti and iat with the caller's identity key\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.453, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     possession proof verified (DPoP)\r\n              jti=e1252ef1… htu=https://payments.acme.example/v1/pay fingerprint=834033fe…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.225, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     liveness verified (status token)\r\n              ansName=ans://v1.0.0.orders.acme.example agentId=agent-orders status=ACTIVE\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.227, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     identity verified (SCITT receipt)\r\n              leafIndex=1 treeSize=2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     caller authenticated\r\n              ansName=ans://v1.0.0.orders.acme.example agentId=agent-orders fingerprint=834033fe…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m 200  payment accepted — authenticated caller: ans://v1.0.0.orders.acme.example\r\n"]
[2.702, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1m⑥ Server side — a captured proof is replayed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m the same request again: same DPoP proof, same jti\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     possession proof verified (DPoP)\r\n              jti=e1252ef1… htu=https://payments.acme.example/v1/pay fingerprint=834033fe…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     liveness verified (status token)\r\n              ansName=ans://v1.0.0.orders.acme.example agentId=agent-orders status=ACTIVE\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.227, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     identity verified (SCITT receipt)\r\n              leafIndex=1 treeSize=2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     caller rejected\r\n              category=REPLAY err=\"pop: REPLAY: jti already seen within the freshness window\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[0m 401  REPLAY\r\n"]
[2.701, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1m⑦ Server side — stolen headers, forged certificate\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  \u001b[2mthe attacker has the caller's public receipt and status token, and mints its own\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[2mkey and certificate for the caller's ans:// name. The proof signature is valid.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m POST https://payments.acme.example/v1/pay   with the attacker's proof\r\n"]
[0.453, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     possession proof verified (DPoP)\r\n              jti=24a7bbcc… htu=https://payments.acme.example/v1/pay fingerprint=b461c8ff…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.225, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     liveness verified (status token)\r\n              ansName=ans://v1.0.0.orders.acme.example agentId=agent-orders status=ACTIVE\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     identity verified (SCITT receipt)\r\n              leafIndex=1 treeSize=2\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     caller rejected\r\n              category=BINDING_FAILED err=\"pop: BINDING_FAILED: proof certificate fingerprint is not\r\n              in the status token's ValidIdentityCerts\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[0m 401  BINDING_FAILED\r\n"]
[2.701, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1m⑧ Server side — a revoked caller\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "  \u001b[2mright key, right certificate, valid proof — but the log says REVOKED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "  \u001b[36m→\u001b[0m POST https://payments.acme.example/v1/pay   as ans://v1.0.0.ledger.acme.example\r\n"]
[0.452, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     possession proof verified (DPoP)\r\n              jti=3d25d0e0… htu=https://payments.acme.example/v1/pay fingerprint=c490ca2f…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "      \u001b[2mpop     caller rejected\r\n              category=STATUS_INVALID err=\"pop: STATUS_INVALID: status token verification failed:\r\n              terminal status [REVOKED]: agent status is REVOKED\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.226, "o", "  \u001b[31m✗\u001b[0m 401  STATUS_INVALID\r\n"]
[2.701, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1mVerify, then connect.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[1mclient → server\u001b[0m   preflight; receipt + status token checked against the log key and bound\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "                    to the TLS certificate. Revoked or expired: refused before the first request.\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[1mserver → client\u001b[0m   DPoP proof + receipt + status token on every request, bound to one\r\n"]
[0.450, "o", "                    identity certificate. Replay, forgery and revocation refused. No mTLS.\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.451, "o", "  \u001b[2mgo run ./examples/verify-then-connect     verify.ServerVerifier.VerifyWithScitt · pop.Middleware\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.702, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
[0.002, "x", "0"]
